# Toolkit update

Read this project's root `CLAUDE.md` or `AGENTS.md` first. Then read
`.claude/commands/toolkit-update.md` in full and follow its reconciliation
workflow exactly. Treat the file as tool-agnostic instructions: its Claude
frontmatter and `/toolkit-update` name do not change the gates.

This skill cannot exist on a scaffold from before Codex support until the
toolkit's plain, flag-free `bin/init.sh --target .` bootstrap has added it.

Never update during an in-flight task, never auto-apply permission changes,
and never overwrite a local customization without the user's explicit choice.
